 , Chelsea Handler\, and Kumail Nanjiani.\n\nPreviously\, Ron has appeared o
 n BET’s Apollo Live and Fox’s Laughs\, and was personally selected by B
 ill Burr to perform on Comedy Central’s stand-up showcase The Ringers. Ro
